# AI episode magazine pages

When creating or rewriting `ai/episode-*.html`, **read and follow** [docs/AI_EPISODE_MAGAZINE.md](docs/AI_EPISODE_MAGAZINE.md) end to end before considering the task done.

**Non‑negotiables:**
- Shell and CSS: copy from `ai/episode-01.html` (figure width `min(34%, 300px)` only).
- Script = source of truth for ideas and order; student tone; bilingual `data-en` / `data-zh`.
- **Balance & density:** Every `.ep-pair` must pass the doc’s rules — no multi‑row gaps beside figures, no thin copy next to spots. Add script‑backed sentences until each pair looks balanced in the layout.
- Run the doc’s **publish checklist** mentally before handing off; fix gaps and CSS drift.

Golden reference: `ai/episode-01.html`.
